(7606193, 1229986, 3306, '<td valign="top">Let me take care of that for you! That must have been a rough night. Well done portrait! I like the lighting. He looks like a good kid that just got into a bad situation.</td>', 'Let me take care of that for you! That must have been a rough night. Well done portrait! I like the lighting. He looks like a good kid that just got into a bad situation.', '2018-12-27 06:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7606194, 1229922, 3306, '<td valign="top">Thats a good shot. Its not easy to get an acceptable image of a diamond.</td>', 'Thats a good shot. Its not easy to get an acceptable image of a diamond.', '2018-12-27 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7606195, 1230016, 3306, '<td valign="top">I would recommend implants to support a new denture. Doesnt look like he has much ridge! The picture Itself is sharp with good color and lighting but the angle has cut off the back teeth. As a clinical picture I would have take it at a different angle and with a lighter background. ;)</td>', 'I would recommend implants to support a new denture. Doesnt look like he has much ridge! The picture Itself is sharp with good color and lighting but the angle has cut off the back teeth. As a clinical picture I would have take it at a different angle and with a lighter background. ;)', '2018-12-27 06:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7606196, 1229835, 3306, '<td valign="top">Love it! I want your dog:)</td>', 'Love it! I want your dog:)', '2018-12-27 06:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7606197, 1230019, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a great scene. I really like the emotion you have portrayed.</td>', 'What a great scene. I really like the emotion you have portrayed.', '2018-12-27 06:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
